142: ### Archive and Active-Scope Boundary Rules
144: - `.planning/` remains a backed-up archive/reference source. It can provide evidence and caveats, but it is not the active execution graph for M001.
145: - M001 intentionally does not perform wholesale `.planning` conversion, exhaustive archive audit, legacy milestone backfill, cost-frontier sweep execution, or snapshot maintenance.
